config BR2_PACKAGE_AR9311_CAPTURE
	bool "AR9311 source capture and ISP drivers (experimental)"
	depends on BR2_FPVOS_SOC_AR9311
	depends on BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
	help
	  Build shared CSI2, VIF, ISP, CVISP and camera clock drivers.
	  Requires a board media graph, DMA pools and sensor tuning.
	  This is experimental; P1 image quality is not yet validated.
